            <p>Sailing Cabo San Lucas allows guests to experience the coast at a more leisurely pace. Smaller boats glide over clear waters and closer to sea lions and magnificent rock formations. The gentle sway of the boat intensifies this feeling of liberation. </p>

            <p>Sailing cabo san lucas excursions frequently sail past hidden beaches and wind- and wave-carved natural arches. The mountain and ocean cliffs present a different feel from other coastlines. It's both an adventurous and tranquil experience. </p>

